{"help": "https://data.gov.ie/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"applicable_legislation": ["http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"], "author": null, "author_email": null, "conforms_to": "GTFS", "contact_email": "david.ruane@nationaltransport.ie", "contact_name": "", "contact_phone": "", "creator_user_id": "0bb4624f-73b1-4c3d-8b90-e6ce3388c609", "frequency": "Daily", "high_value_dataset": true, "hvd_category": "http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_b79e35eb", "id": "2c82f1c8-75f3-43c0-9f3c-d55abb7f3f29", "isopen": true, "language": "en", "license_id": "CC-BY-4.0", "license_title": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "metadata_created": "2026-02-12T08:37:31.268285", "metadata_modified": "2026-10-15T15:42:56.300557", "name": "nta-gtfs", "notes_translated": {"en": "GTFS Schedule is a feed specification that defines a common format for static public transportation information. It is composed of a collection of simple files, mostly text files (.txt) that are contained in a single ZIP file.\r\n\r\nEach file describes a particular aspect of transit information such as stops, routes, trips, etc. At its most basic form, a GTFS Schedule dataset is composed of 7 files: agency.txt, routes.txt, trips.txt, stops.txt, stop_times.txt, calendar.txt and calendar_dates.txt.\r\n\r\nThe GTFS Realtime feed provides realtime information and can be used in conjunction with the GTFS schedule file.\r\n\r\nAn API key is needed to access GTFS Realtime. This requires creating a developer account at the NTA developer portal: https://developer.nationaltransport.ie/", "ga": "Is sonra\u00edocht fotha \u00e9 Sceideal GTFS a shainmh\u00edn\u00edonn form\u00e1id choiteann d\u2019fhaisn\u00e9is iompair phoibl\u00ed statach. T\u00e1 s\u00e9 comhdh\u00e9anta de bhaili\u00fach\u00e1n de chomhaid shimpl\u00ed, comhaid t\u00e9acs (.txt) den chuid is m\u00f3, at\u00e1 i gcomhad ZIP amh\u00e1in.\r\n\r\nD\u00e9anann gach ceann de na comhaid cur s\u00edos ar ghn\u00e9 \u00e1irithe d\u2019fhaisn\u00e9is iompair amhail stadanna, beala\u00ed, turais, etc. Ag an bhfoirm is bun\u00fasa\u00ed, t\u00e1 tacar sonra\u00ed Sceideal GTFS comhdh\u00e9anta de 7 gcomhad: agency.txt, routes.txt, trips.txt, stops.txt, stop_times.txt, calendar.txt agus calendar_dates.txt.\r\n\r\nD\u00e9anann fotha Fh\u00edor-am GTFS faisn\u00e9is f\u00edor-ama a chur ar f\u00e1il, agus is f\u00e9idir \u00e9 a \u00fas\u00e1id in \u00e9ineacht le comhad sceideal GTFS.\r\n"}, "num_resources": 7, "num_tags": 4, "organization": {"id": "national-transport-authority", "name": "national-transport-authority", "title": "National Transport Authority", "type": "organization", "description": "The National Transport Authority is a State body set up under statute in 2009. The role and functions of the Authority are set out in two Acts of the Oireachtas; the Dublin Transport Authority Act 2008 and the Public Transport Regulation Act 2009.\r\n\r\nHomepage: http://www.nationaltransport.ie/", "image_url": "2018-03-20-204715.246618National-Transport-Authority.jpg", "created": "2018-03-05T11:28:31.824504", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "national-transport-authority", "private": false, "provenance": "", "rights": "", "spatial": "", "spatial_other": "", "spatial_resolution": "", "spatial_uri": "", "srs": [], "state": "active", "temporal": "", "theme": "Transport", "title": "NTA GTFS and GTFS Realtime", "title_translated": {"en": "NTA GTFS and GTFS Realtime", "ga": ""}, "type": "dataset", "url": "https://www.transportforireland.ie/transitData/PT_Data.html", "version": "", "vertical_extent": "", "resources": [{"access_url": "https://www.transportforireland.ie/transitData/Data/GTFS_All.zip", "api_access_url": "", "api_response_formats": [], "api_type": "", "applicable_legislation": [], "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null,